==English==
[[Image:Waldohreule_in_freier_Wildbahn.jpg|thumb|160px|A long eared owl]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˌlɒŋɪədˈaʊl/|nocount=1}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Persent101-long-eared owl.wav|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# ''[[Asio otus]]'', a species of [[owl]] which breeds in Europe, Asia, and North America. Long eared owls are partially migratory, moving south in winter from the northern parts of their range.

====Synonyms====
* {{taxlink|Strix otus|species}} {{qualifier|former taxonomic name}}
* [[medium-sized owl]]
* {{taxlink|Owenus wilsonus|species}} {{qualifier|former taxonomic name}}

